WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Meet JackedIN, the console app built for network engineers.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.000
SSH, Telnet and serial in one window, with tabs, saved sessions,
and logging that's on from the start.

3
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.400
Ping, traceroute and a port scan are built right in.

4
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:19.000
Prefer the keyboard? The same tools run from the command line,
ready for your scripts.

5
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.300
And when you're ready to automate, turn on the local API.

6
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.900
It listens only on your own machine and needs a secret token,

7
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:29.800
so your scripts and automation tools can open a session,
send a command,

8
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.600
wait for the output, and close it.

9
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.300
Try it before you buy it.

10
00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:37.400
Every feature is free for three days. No card, no sign-up.

11
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.500
Then it's $19, one time, at launch.

12
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:43.400
Windows and Linux today, Mac coming soon.

13
00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:46.720
Get JackedIN at getjackedin.com
